      "content": "It is completely understandable that facing generalized advice feels empty when you feel your entire self has disappeared. When the past seems utterly lost, the present can feel incredibly pointless. Please consider speaking with a therapist who specializes in existential despair, as they can help you start building a new sense of self in the present moment. You deserve to find a path forward, even if that path looks completely different from what used to be.",
      "source": "target",
